Rust crates in the DroppedNeedle server
=======================================

The droppedneedle and droppedneedle-tool programs in this image are built
from the Rust crates below. Each licence text found in their packages is
given in full, under the list of crates it covers. A crate whose package holds
no text of its licence gets that licence's standard text, and its authors are
named beside it. The address beside a crate is its published source on
crates.io; that is where the source of the MPL-2.0 crates is.

